---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site, contactUrl } from '../config/site';
---
<Legal title="Privacy"><h2>Who we are</h2><p>{site.brand} publishes DIY relocation guides. For privacy requests, contact <a href={contactUrl}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p><h2>Information on this site</h2><p>This site has no forms. With your consent, the Meta Pixel collects information about page views, guide previews and clicks to checkout for analytics and advertising. We do not load the Pixel or its advertising cookies before you accept.</p><p>We store your cookie choice and a timestamp in your browser’s local storage. You can change your choice through Cookie settings in the footer. Declining or withdrawing consent prevents future Pixel loading; withdrawing consent reloads the page.</p><h2>Payments and delivery</h2><p>Selar handles payments and digital delivery. Payment and order information is handled under <a href={site.legal.selarPrivacy} rel="noopener">Selar’s privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>Under applicable data protection law, including the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and UK GDPR, you may request access to or deletion of your personal information, object to processing, and withdraw consent. Email <a href={contactUrl}>{site.contactEmail}</a> to make a request.</p></Legal>
